---
description: Exeter VPN repo conventions and safety rules
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow AGENTS.md at the repo root. Key points: `bin/exeter-vpn` is a single-file bash CLI with no
dependencies; "VIA Next/New Pin" means wrong credentials; only one VIA client (GUI or CLI) at a time;
ask before connect/disconnect/login/install or sudo; never commit or print credentials, profile.xml,
cookies, HAR files, or `private/`; test with `bash -n` and read-only `exeter-vpn doctor|status`.
